{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2023-02-02 09:30:00', 'title': "KROGER AWARDED RIPPLEMATCH'S 2023 CAMPUS FORWARD AWARD", 'text': 'GROCER RECOGNIZED NATIONALLY FOR VALUING GENERATION Z, EARLY-CAREER ASSOCIATES CINCINNATI , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA\'S GROCER, HAS BEEN AWARDED THE 2023 CAMPUS FORWARD AWARD IN THE ENTERPRISE EARLY CAREER PROGRAMS CATEGORY FOR EXCELLENCE IN EARLY CAREER HIRING. "WITH SIX GENERATIONS MAKING UP OUR WORKFORCE, KROGER UNDERSTANDS THE IMPORTANCE OF EARLY TALENT DEVELOPMENT AND HOW IMPACTFUL INTERNSHIP PROGRAMS CAN DEFINE OUR COMPANY CULTURE FOR YEARS TO COME," SAID TIM MASSA, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF PEOPLE OFFICER AT KROGER.'}